<title>FINLAND: FORECAST-NOKIAN RENKAAT 4-M PROFIT SEEN UP.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-NOKIAN RENKAAT 4-M PROFIT SEEN UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Reuters survey of analysts</p>
<p>covering Finnish equities showed a 33 million markka median</p>
<p>forecast for Finnish tyre maker Nokian Renkaat Oy's</p>
<p>January-April profit before extraordinary items and tax.</p>
<p>		    Profit before extras, tax</p>
<p>			  (FIM million)</p>
<p>    Median		  33</p>
<p>    Mean		    32</p>
<p>    Lowest		  24</p>
<p>    Highest		 37</p>
<p>(Forecasts by five analysts).</p>
<p>Nokian Renkaat's results are due on June 4 at 0800/0500 GMT.</p>
<p>In January-April 1996, Nokian Renkaat posted a profit of 28</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>Contributors to the survey were Aktia Bank, Carnegie</p>
<p>Securities, Erik Selin, Evli Securities and Merita Securities.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom 358-9-680 50 292, reuters@news.fi</p>
</text>
